$$
\begin{array}{lll}
\mathrm{X}^{+2} & \mathrm{Y}^{+5} & \mathrm{Z}^{-2}
\end{array}
$$
Overall charge on compound formed by elements X. Y and $\mathrm{Z}$ should be zero.
$$
\begin{aligned}
& \mathrm{X}_3\left(\mathrm{YZ}_4\right)_2 \Rightarrow 3 \times 2+2 \times 5+8 \times(-2)=0 \\
& \mathrm{X}\left(\mathrm{Y}_4 \mathrm{Z}\right) \Rightarrow 1 \times 2+4 \times 5+1 \times(-2) \neq 0 \\
& \mathrm{X}_3\left(\mathrm{YZ}_2\right)_2 \Rightarrow 3 \times 2+2 \times 5+4 \times(-2) \neq 0 \\
& \mathrm{XYZ}_2 \Rightarrow 1 \times 2+1 \times 5+2 \times(-2) \neq 0
\end{aligned}
$$
